# TaskTrack CLI Usage

TaskTrack is a simple command line task manager written in Java.

## Compile

javac src/main/java/com/tasktrack/*.java

## Run

java com.tasktrack.Main

## Features

- Add tasks
- List tasks
- Complete tasks
- Delete tasks
- Automatic file storage

## Example Output

0 [ ] Learn GitHub
1 [x] Finish Java project
2 [ ] Study GitHub Actions

## File Storage

Tasks are stored in:

tasks.txt
